# Verify that ALL args route to the correct typed bucket (not just the head).
# ...ss@String collects "a","b" (2 strings); ...ns@Int collects 1,2,3 (3 ints).
# Using length to count bucket contents verifies full routing, not just head().
[call [fn [let]
  [f: [fn [let ...ss@String ...ns@Int ...rest] [length ns]]]
  [f "a" 1 "b" 2 3]]]
=== out
Int(3)
